{
  "name": "Pstore: pin fan-out hub",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "Fan-out hub — one inbound webhook, many socials\n\nPOST one pin-shaped payload to the \"Inbound webhook\" URL:\n{\"title\":\"...\",\"description\":\"...\",\"link\":\"...\",\"image\":\"https://pstore-gxbv.onrender.com/og/<slug>.png\"}\n\nEach channel is gated by its flag in the \"Normalize payload\" node's TOGGLES constant:\n- Telegram photo — works today, zero approval (BotFather token only).\n- Facebook page photo — needs a Meta app + Page token; single Graph API call, no further review once your page has the publish permission.\n- Mastodon status — any instance + access token; posts text+link (cards unfurl the og image). Upgrade to media upload via /api/v2/media + binary \"Download\" node when you want the raw artwork.\n\nREALITY CHECK (make.com's multi-social posting included): X, Instagram and Threads require YOUR OWN account + app approval on EVERY tool. No workflow, n8n or Make, can post there without it. Flip this template's pattern (IF toggle -> HTTP node) to add them once each platform approves you."
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000020",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -560,
        -320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "pstore-fanout",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000021",
      "name": "Inbound webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        -340,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Accept any pin-shaped payload, normalise it, and attach per-channel\n// enable switches. Flip a flag to true once that channel is set up.\nconst TOGGLES = { telegram: true, facebook: false, mastodon: false };\n\nconst out = [];\nfor (const it of $input.all()) {\n  const j = it.json ?? {};\n  out.push({ json: {\n    title: String(j.title ?? j.name ?? 'pstore pick'),\n    description: String(j.description ?? j.caption ?? ''),\n    link: String(j.link ?? j.pin_url ?? j.url ?? ''),\n    image: String(j.image ?? j.image_url ?? j.media ?? ''),\n    ...TOGGLES,\n  }});\n}\nreturn out;"
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000022",
      "name": "Normalize payload",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -140,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
